[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "london-nc6 3.e3"]
[Name "2...Nc6 and 3...a6"]

3... a6 { Keeps White's pieces off b5, but it does nothing for development. }
4. Nf3 { White simply develops. Every slow move Black makes is a move White spends on the set-up. }
4... Nf6
( 4... f6? { Another slow pawn move. Black has now spent two moves on pawns that develop nothing. }
  5. c4 e6 6. Nc3 { c4 hits d5, the knight joins in, and White is far ahead in development. Nothing is won yet: the gain is time, and the engine has White about a pawn and a half ahead. } )
5. Nbd2 *
